<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; background-color: #f7f9fc; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding: 28px 12px;">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;">
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 28px 18px;">
            <img
              src="<%= attachments[UserMailer::WELCOME_LOGO_FILENAME].url %>"
              alt="MatchMuster"
              width="112"
              style="display: block; width: 112px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;"
            >
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding: 0 34px 34px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #14213d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">Hi <%= @first_name %>,</p>

            <h1 style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25;">
              Welcome to MatchMuster!
            </h1>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">We’re delighted to have you with us.</p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              MatchMuster gives you one place to stay connected with your team and keep track of everything happening throughout the season.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>As a player, you can:</strong></p>

            <ul style="margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 24px;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Join your team using its invite code</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Confirm your availability for fixtures and training</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">View upcoming matches, training sessions and locations</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">See when you have been selected for the starting squad or substitutes</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Receive important updates and notifications from your managers</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Read team announcements and matchday information</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">View and pay Match Subs requests</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Let your team know if you are running late</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Keep track of your match statistics and team awards</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Take part in Player of the Match ratings</li>
            </ul>

            <div style="margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 18px; background-color: #eef5ff; border-left: 4px solid #2f80ed; border-radius: 10px;">
              <strong>MatchMuster is completely free for players.</strong>
              You will never need to purchase a subscription to join your team or use the player features.
            </div>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              To get started, join your team using the invite code provided by your manager. Once your manager approves your request, you’ll be able to view your team and start responding to fixtures and training sessions.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 18px;">
              If you have any questions or need help with your account, contact us at
              <a href="mailto:support@matchmuster.uk" style="color: #2f80ed; text-decoration: underline;">support@matchmuster.uk</a>.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
              Welcome to the MatchMuster family. We’re excited to have you as part of the journey.
            </p>

            <p style="margin: 0;">
              Kind regards,<br><br>
              <strong>Patrick</strong><br>
              Founder of MatchMuster<br>
              <a href="https://www.matchmuster.uk" style="color: #2f80ed; text-decoration: none;">www.matchmuster.uk</a>
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
